                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lembe ma Yeremia ma jabila yero ni Baruc ma wod Neria, kinde m’egoro lembe maeni i kitabu ku dhu Yeremia, i rundi mir ang’wende mi camuker pa Yehoiakim ma wod Yosia, m’ubimo mi Yuda, m’ewacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, uwacu iri kumae, E Baruc: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwacu kumae, Can i wia ka wono! kum Yehova medo can ni remokum para; aol ku cur para, man anwang’u yom ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac ire kumae, Yehova wacu kumae: Nen, maeno m’agomo abirwombo piny, man maeno m’apidho abifudho; man maeni i ng’om dho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man iyenyo gin ma dit iri giri? kud iyenygi; kum, nen, abikelo lem ma rac wi weg kum ceke, Yehova wacu; kum abimio kwo peri ni amaci i kaka ceke m’icidho i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
